## 🌟 About Pixenture

**Pixenture** is an action-packed platformer game featuring charming retro pixel art and classic side-scrolling gameplay. Set in a vibrant, nostalgic world, your objective is simple yet challenging: collect delicious fruits to fill your progress bar, dodge cunning enemies (**Mask Dudes**), and safely reach the finish line to conquer each level!

### Key Features
* 🎨 **Retro Pixel Art Style:** Immerse yourself in beautifully crafted pixelated environments and animations.
* 🕹️ **Side-Scrolling Action:** Test your platforming skills with fluid side-by-side movement and obstacle navigation.
* 🍓 **Fruit Collection Mechanic:** Gather scattered fruits across the map to fill up your level progression bar.
* ⚠️ **Dynamic Threats:** Stay alert and evade the patrol of sneaky **Mask Dudes** to survive and advance.
